                                "sense_id": "bfd3ad64-e132-3e91-bd50-873676ad4bfe",
                                "text": "Last week the Finns gave the world a good example of sisu by carrying the war into Russian territory on one front while on another they withstood merciless attacks by a reinforced Russian Army.",
                                "translation": "上週，芬蘭人向世界展示了堅韌不拔的精神的良好榜樣，他們在一條戰線上將戰爭推進到俄羅斯領土，同時在另一條戰線上抵擋住了加強後的俄羅斯軍隊的無情攻擊。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f1b6e50-912a-4486-9ec7-d8e388f7c243",
                                "sense_id": "bfd3ad64-e132-3e91-bd50-873676ad4bfe",
                                "text": "People living in northern climates need plenty of sisu.",
                                "translation": "生活在北方氣候地區的人們需要很強的堅韌不拔的精神。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39a4d03a-2cd6-4557-8d3a-e9b97b9a5a4e",
                                "sense_id": "bfd3ad64-e132-3e91-bd50-873676ad4bfe",
                                "text": "We agreed there was a pressing need for a systematic investigation of sisu, how Finns think about it, how it is propagated.",
                                "translation": "我們一致認為，迫切需要對堅韌不拔的精神進行系統性研究，了解芬蘭人如何看待它，以及它是如何傳播的。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "94c68634-b8a8-4340-abde-8db8e06dcba5",
                                "sense_id": "bfd3ad64-e132-3e91-bd50-873676ad4bfe",
                                "text": "Life requires all of us to have a certain level of sisu when things get tough, which they inevitably will.",
                                "translation": "生活要求我們每個人在遇到困難時都要具備一定的堅韌不拔的精神，而困難是不可避免的。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
